OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fbecoming increasingly confined to
OL,7,Fnorthern and eastern Aberdeenshire
OL,8,Fovernight. Long clear spells develop
OL,9,Fin south and west, with a touch of
OL,10,Ffrost possible in well-sheltered spots.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA few early showers in
OL,13,Fnortheast, otherwise a chilly start
OL,14,Fwith sunny spells. Increasing cloud
OL,15,Fbrings outbreaks of rain east through
OL,16,Fthe late afternoon and evening.
OL,17,FFreshening southerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
