OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,6,FOccasionally heavy rain clearing
OL,7,Fovernight then sunny spells and
OL,8,Fblustery showers Friday, the showers
OL,9,Fbecoming heavier, more frequent
OL,10,FSaturday with northwesterly coastal
OL,11,Fgales. Mainly dry and bright Sunday,
OL,12,Fwinds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
